   "text": "第四十四条　网络运营者不得泄露、篡改、毁损其收集的个人信息；"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-cybersecurity-law-2016:44/s2",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "未经被收集者同意，不得向他人提供个人信息。"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-cybersecurity-law-2016:44/s4",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "network_operator",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "SUBMITTED",
   "rule": "zh:internal-record",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "网络运营者应当采取技术措施和其他必要措施，确保其收集的个人信息安全，防止信息泄露、毁损、丢失。"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-cybersecurity-law-2016:44/s5",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "OBSERVED",
   "rule": "zh:public-trace",
   "status": "DRAFT",
